Package: com.itsallexb.batteryplus
Name: BatteryPlus (iOS 12)
Version: 1.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Battery features of modern iOS for iOS 12 iPads. Low Power Mode in Settings > Battery and in Control Center (with CCSupport), battery colours in the status bar like modern iOS (yellow in Low Power Mode, green while charging, red at 20%), and the battery percentage inside the battery icon, also like modern iOS (optional). Battery Health with Maximum Capacity, Cycle Count and Manufacture Date from the battery's gas gauge, and an optional Unplug Reminder.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0)
Recommends: com.opa334.ccsupport
